    {
      "Id": "dedee5a3-b60b-4fdf-8d29-c6f069100b27",
      "Description": "A useful shading technique is to add a [SetFog] operator.\nIt can be used to darken or colorize objects based on distance."
    },
    {
      "Id": "c06402e6-a961-4fa4-a17e-c3b0009034de",
      "Description": "In this example, the far view distance introduces too much visual noise."
    },
    {
      "Id": "4be91145-ee25-48b7-8341-56d7222aea62",
      "Description": "Find the correct distance to match the reference.",
      "Style": "CallToAction"
    }
